WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.170
(dramatic music)

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.110
- [Narrator] In the middle
of a political upheaval,

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:07.340
one Ukrainian zookeeper set
out to make a difference

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.741
in his own way, on the private estate

00:00:09.741 --> 00:00:11.523
of an ousted president.

00:00:15.232 --> 00:00:17.050
(mellow music)

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.309
Sergey used to be a
zoologist at the Kiev Zoo.

00:00:20.309 --> 00:00:25.309
(Sergey speaking in foreign language)

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.150
- [Narrator] One night in
2014, he was watching the news

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.750
and learned that amidst the chaos,

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.920
Ukrainian president Viktor Yanukovych

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.240
had fled his compound in Mezhyhirya,

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.113
leaving his private zoo behind.

00:00:37.281 --> 00:00:41.864
(Sergey speaking in foreign language)

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.610
- [Narrator] When he
arrived, Sergey was stunned

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.190
by the huge opulent estate

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:48.705
and saw the animals needed desperate care.

00:00:48.705 --> 00:00:53.288
(Sergey speaking in foreign language)

00:01:01.084 --> 00:01:03.340
- [Narrator] What he thought
might be just a few days,

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:04.995
has turned into four years.

00:01:04.995 --> 00:01:09.578
(Sergey speaking in foreign language)

00:01:30.472 --> 00:01:32.810
- [Narrator] Today, Sergey
and a handful of volunteers

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:35.875
take care of thousands
of animals on the estate.

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:40.375
(Sergey speaking in foreign language)

00:01:58.921 --> 00:02:00.779
(mellow piano music)

00:02:00.779 --> 00:02:02.320
- [Narrator] The zoo is slowly growing,

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:05.449
and Sergey has big hopes for the future.

00:02:05.449 --> 00:02:09.949
(Sergey speaking in foreign language)

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.613
(bright music)

